  },
  {
   "text": "The VAT and A-skat arrears with Skattestyrelsen, the informal deferral, and any formal instalment arrangement - requires a Danish tax adviser or lawyer; late A-skat can carry personal liability for management.",
   "domain": "tax"
  },
  {
   "text": "Any restructuring, moratorium or rekonstruktion under the Danish Bankruptcy Act (konkursloven), including whether preventive restructuring is available or advisable - requires an insolvency lawyer.",
   "domain": "licensing_and_certification"
  },
  {
   "text": "Collective redundancy consultation and notice obligations under the Dansk Metal / DI collective agreement and the Danish Act on Collective Redundancies if headcount reduction exceeds thresholds - requires employment law advice.",
   "domain": "employment_law"
  },
  {
   "text": "The personal guarantee and house security given by the MD, its enforceability and any renegotiation with Jyske Bank - requires independent personal legal advice separate from the company's adviser.",
   "domain": "legal_contract"
  },
